![framework](assets/framework.png)

---

## 📊 Dataset (MMD-C)

We release the dataset used in this paper for multimodal detection under degradation.

### 🔥 Key Features
- Optical–SAR paired data
- Controlled cloud degradation
- Multi-level severity: 0 → 1.0
- Realistic heterogeneous degradation setting

